---
import TradePanel from "./TradePanel.astro";
---
<section class="tab-panel active" data-panel="overview" aria-label="Overview">
  <div class="metric-grid" id="overview-metrics"><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">AGREEMENTS</span><strong data-metric="agreements">—</strong><span>tracked on the ASC</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">XAU / USD</span><strong data-metric="spot">—</strong><span data-metric="spot-round">last proved round</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">PROOFS</span><strong data-metric="proofs">—</strong><span>facts carried on-chain</span></article><article class="metric-card violet"><span class="eyebrow">MARGIN CALLS</span><strong data-metric="margin">—</strong><span>coverage below maintenance</span></article></div>
  <TradePanel />
  <div class="overview-grid"><article class="surface activity-surface"><div class="surface-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LIVE WORKSPACE</span><h3>Lifecycle activity</h3></div><button class="quiet-button" data-refresh>Refresh ↻</button></div><div id="activity-list" class="activity-list"><div class="loading-row">Loading desk state…</div></div></article><article class="surface readiness-surface"><span class="eyebrow">ATTESTED SOURCE CHAINS</span><h3 id="readiness-title">Two chains. One book.</h3><p id="readiness-copy">Collateral custody and mark-to-market arrive from different chains, each attested independently.</p><div id="chain-lines"></div><div class="readiness-line"><span><i class="ready-dot"></i> Signing</span><strong id="wallet-state">Wallet not connected</strong></div><a href="#" data-open-tab="attest">Inspect the proof path <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div>
</section>
